            <ArticleTitle>[Celiac plexus block: value of x-ray computed guidance].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>267-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Celiac plexus block is a good alternative of pain treatment in upper abdominal pain. Neurolysis of the celiac plexus by the percutaneous posterior route used CT guidance in 8 patients. Pain relief was obtained in 5 of 7 patients (70 per cent); no complication occurred.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
